  "Check which released models have documentation confirming that they use Engram.": "查看具体模型的公开说明，确认它是否使用了 Engram。",
  "Distinguish interpreting a picture from assigning work to several agents.": "区分理解图像与向多个智能体分配工作这两项能力。",
