  "Run the assistant on a few typical tasks in your project, using the tools it will actually have. Decide in advance which observable result counts as success.": "选几项有代表性的项目任务，让助手用实际可用的工具完成。事先约定可观察的验收标准。",
  "Trace the word “pump” through two diagrams. In one, an arrow connects “pump” to another word. In the other, an arrow at “pump” connects layer 3 to layer 8. What does each arrow connect?": "追踪“水泵”一词的两条连线。第一条连到句中的另一个词；第二条在“水泵”的同一位置，从第 3 层连到第 8 层。它们各连接什么？",
  "You can mark the first arrow across columns for token position and the second across rows for layer number.": "在表格上把词元位置作为列、层数作为行，第一条线跨列，第二条线跨行。",
  "How much space remains for the answer?": "留给回答的上下文空间有多少？",
  "How a context-budget reminder changed one benchmark score": "告知剩余词元数怎样影响一项测试的得分",
