  "Read the central idea and learning goals. Look up only the unfamiliar terms you need.": "先弄清核心想法和学习目标。遇到妨碍理解的术语再查词典。",
  "Read selectively · about 5–15 minutes": "按问题读原文 · 约 5 至 15 分钟",
  "Use the reading route to find the problem, method, key figure and results. Follow equations when they answer your question.": "按建议顺序找出研究问题、方法、关键图和结果。在需要解释具体问题时，再仔细读相应的公式。",
