  "The original evaluation measured translation quality. If your goal is to answer factual questions about a manual, what would you test next?": "原论文测量的是翻译质量。如果你关心模型能否根据手册回答事实性问题，下一步应测什么？",
  "Choose questions whose answers can be checked against the manual. Include questions the manual leaves unanswered. Measure how often the model gives the supported answer or correctly says that the information is missing.": "选择能从手册中核实答案的问题，同时加入手册没有给出答案的问题。统计模型能否答对有依据的问题，以及资料不足时能否明确说明。",
  "Cover a word halfway through a sentence. Which words may BERT use to recover it? Which would a next-token model have seen when originally predicting it?": "遮住句子中间的一个词。BERT 可以用哪些词还原它？若是逐词元生成模型，在生成这个词时已经看到了哪些词？",
  "A model answers a test question correctly. You later find the identical question and answer in its training data. How does that change your interpretation of the result?": "模型答对了一道测试题。后来你发现完全相同的题目和答案出现在训练数据中。该怎样重新解读这次答对？",
  "A user asks for a delivery date. Before the model writes an answer, what can the retriever supply?": "用户想查交货日期。模型开始写回答之前，检索器可以提供什么？",
  "The LoRA example needs 98.4% fewer trainable entries. What additional information would you need to estimate total memory in bytes?": "LoRA 例子中的可训练参数减少了 98.4%。要估计训练总共占用多少字节，还需要知道什么？",
  "Count the stored base weights as well as the adapters, intermediate activations, gradients and optimizer state. For each, check how many values are stored and how many bytes each takes. A percentage for one matrix cannot supply that total.": "除了适配器，还要统计原模型权重、中间激活值、梯度和优化器状态。查清每类要存多少个值、每个值占多少字节，再求和。一个矩阵的参数降幅无法直接给出总量。",
  "Suppose the target model gives a wrong place name a 10% probability as its next token. With exact speculative decoding, what happens to that probability?": "假设目标模型给一个错误地名的对应词元 10% 的概率。如果使用能精确保留分布的推测解码，这个概率会怎样？",
  "It stays at 10% under the same context and sampling settings. Verification here means checking the sampling rule against the target model. Neither model has looked up the place name in a reliable source.": "在上下文和抽样设置相同的条件下，它仍是 10%。这里的“核验”指按目标模型的分布校正抽样。这个步骤并没有查证地名是否真实。",
  "The stored weights fit in a quarter of the space. What would you time to find out whether fine-tuning actually runs faster?": "权重占用的存储空间降到四分之一。要判断微调是否真的变快，应当怎样计时？",
  "Time training on the same hardware with a comparable batch and sequence length. Include conversion from 4-bit storage, forward and backward calculations, and parameter updates. Memory capacity and elapsed time measure different things.": "在同一硬件上，用可比的批量大小和序列长度训练并计时。把 4 位数值的转换、前向计算、反向计算和参数更新都算进去。占用空间和实际耗时是两个指标。",
  "In grouped-query attention, which information can several query heads reuse?": "在分组查询注意力中，多个查询头可以共用什么信息？",
  "A separate set of keys and values for each query head.": "每个查询头都有一套彼此独立的键和值。",
  "A set of keys and values shared by the query heads in the same group.": "同一组查询头共用的一套键和值。",
  "The same query vector for every token position.": "所有词元位置都用同一个查询向量。",
  "You want to know whether a particular released model uses Engram. What evidence would establish that?": "你想知道某个已发布模型是否采用了 Engram。什么证据能确认这件事？",
  "Look for an architecture description or released implementation for the named model that explicitly includes Engram. The research experiment tells you how its authors tested the module; by itself it gives no inventory of the lab’s deployed models.": "查看该模型自己的架构说明或公开实现，确认其中明确包含 Engram。研究实验记录了作者如何测试这个模块，但没有逐一说明实验室发布的每个模型都采用了什么。",
  "Two agents each use 3,000 tokens and finish in parallel. What would you count to compare elapsed time and token cost with one agent working alone?": "两个智能体分别用了 3,000 个词元，并行完成任务。与一个智能体单独工作相比，应分别怎样统计实际耗时和词元费用？",
  "Time the whole task from start to the checked result. For cost, add the 6,000 tokens across both agents plus any coordination and retries, pricing input and output separately where applicable. Compare with the same measurements for the single-agent run.": "从任务开始到结果通过核对为止计时。成本方面，先合计两个智能体的 6,000 个词元，再计入协调和重试，必要时分别按输入和输出价格计费。用相同口径统计单个智能体的结果。",
  "Which two design choices does the GLM-5 report discuss for training systems that handle longer interactions?": "为了训练能处理更长交互过程的系统，GLM-5 报告讨论了哪两项设计？"
